\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Two double cosets}
\date{2026-11-21}

\p{Two double cosets give a preserved space of rank #{2}, by
\ref{fdip-012D}. The sign edge of \ref{fdip-012H} is the case of
a trivial stabilizer. \ref{fdip-0115} is the case of a stabilizer
of order two inside #{S_3}. The witness of \ref{fdip-0126} has
#{12} double cosets, so its one-edge space is the rank-#{12}
case of the same proposition.}
